 "title": "Welcome to Dickinson County, MI",
 "text": "Welcome to Dickinson County, MI\nHome\nGovernment\nCounty Services\nDickinson County Library\nDickinson County Fair\nHealth Department\nHospital Healthcare System\nRoad Commission\nConstruction Code\nFord Airport (IMT)\nVeterans Affairs\nMSU Extension\nCounty Departments\nBoard of Commissioners*\nCounty Controller\nCounty Court System\nCounty Clerk*\nRegister of Deeds*\nCounty Treasurer*\nEqualization\nSheriff's Department*\nLake Antoine Park/Campground\nDrain Commissioner*\nResidents\nLocal Area Information\nCities And Townships\nLocal Schools\nPublic Library and branches\nFor Pets and Wildlife\nRecreation\nTourist Information\nCounty Links\nCounty History Development\nCourthouse\nDemographic Information\nElected Officials\nFinancial Dashboard\nElections\nVoter Information\nEducation\nHealthCare\nSenior Citizens\nMilitary Veterans\nWelcome\nCities And Townships\nTourist Information\nRecreation\nBusiness\nCounty records information\nDemographic Information\nEmployment Opportunities\nHow Do I\nPay fines\nApply For\nAssumed Name DBAs\nBirth Certificates\nConcealed Weapons Licenses\nDeath Certificates\nDivorces\nMarriage Licenses\nEmployment Opportunities\nContact\nUseful Phone Numbers\nBoard Meeting Minutes\nRecording Documents\nFind Information On\nGo\nPrev Next\nRegister of Deeds\nHome Government County Departments Register of Deeds\nSub Menu\nRegister of Deeds Information links\nRecording Documents\nMichigan Transfer Tax Exemptions\nDickinson County Transfer Tax Exemptions\nRegister Of Deeds Online Search\nMichigan Real Estate Transfer\nRegister of Deeds\nThe Register of Deeds Office is where people record documents relating to land transactions. Different types of deeds as well as land contracts, mortgages, liens, surveys, land corners and lease agreements are recorded at the Office. The Office also has copies of plats and corner records.\nOffice location:\n705 S. Stephenson Ave., Iron Mountain MI 49801\n(906) 774-0955\nDickinson County officials as of 11-2020\nRegister of Deeds:\nCarol Bronzyk clerkcarol@dickinsoncountymi. gov\nShannon Lundholm regdshannon@dickinsoncountymi.gov\nEileen Matchett clerkeileen@dickinsoncountymi.gov\nHow does someone search for documents?\nRegister of Deeds online search\nSimple searches can be performed by the Register of Deeds staff using a legal description and/or name provided, depending on the date of recording. For in-depth searches, customers will need to contact a local title Company or an independent title searcher. We do not perform title searches.\nMichigan Real Estate Transfer Tax\nPlease note: This office DOES NOT PREPARE DOCUMENTS and DOES NOT ANSWER LEGAL QUESTIONS. We do simple searches only—we do not provide title searches. Please contact an attorney if you need legal assistance, or your local title company for assistance with in-depth searches.\nHow much does this research cost?\nTract Index Fee (recordings prior to 1994) = $6.25 per 15 min.\nComputer Search Fee (recordings after 1994) = $5 per search\nCopies = $1 per page (paper or PDF copy)\nSearch fees can be paid with cash, check or credit.\nMethods of payment accepted:\nCash (not able to break large bills)\nChecks and Money orders\nPlease make checks and money orders payable to: “Register of Deeds”\nCredit card use incurs service fee\nCredit card payments must include: Full Name on Card, Card Number & Expiration Date (MM/YY), 3-Digit V-Code & Billing Address.\nRecording services\nCSC eRecording Solutions\nIndecomm Global Services\nThe Dickinson County Register of Deeds does not accept the following document types as eRecordings:\n• Court certified documents\n• Death Certificates\n• Surveys\n• Corners\n• Master Deeds and/or Amendments to Master Deeds\n• Plat Recordings\n• Any document utilizing a RETTVA\nIf you have questions about documents you’d like to eRecord, please call our office at (906) 774-0955.\nCounty Departments\nBoard Of Commissioners\nCounty Controller\nCounty Clerk\nRegister Of Deeds\nCounty Treasurer\nEqualization\nCounty Departments\nSheriff's Department\nParks\nFord Airport\nProsecuting Attorney\nCourt System\nQuicklinks\nContact information\nElections\nCalendar\nParks & Rec\nBirth, Death & Marriage Records\nTaxes\nTraffic Tickets\nSmall Claims\nMeeting Minutes & Agendas\nEmployment Opportunities\nPassport Information\nCounty Committee application for public\nContact Us\n705 S. Stephenson Ave.\nIron Mountain MI 49801\nMailing Address\nPO Box 609\nIron Mountain MI 49801\npowered by revize. , The Government Website Experts. |\nLogin\nSHARE\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.dickinsoncountymi.gov/government/county_departments/register_of_deeds/index.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nGoogle Plus\nReddit\nClose",
